# Frontend stack

The app at the repo root is SvelteKit 2 + Svelte 5. The Next.js migration already landed. Do not add `next`, `react`, or React-ecosystem packages, and do not start a second frontend.

Product work here is Cards, Quest, and BMX triage on the existing scaffold. Stack rationale is in `docs/TDD.md` §2. Dependabot alerts for this manifest are npm at `/`. They are not a reason to restore Next.js.
